  "description": "What assets will pump short term and long term",
  "body_html": "<p>Full disclosure…the title is a bit click bait…but if a full fledged WW3 does in fact kick off, we have all the catalysts required for that. Apologies for the fear bait…but this is social media and I must. </p><p>If you are a <em><strong>short term investor</strong></em> there are only 3 real sectors I would consider right now:</p><ol><li><p>Gold &amp; Silver</p></li><li><p>Oil Companies</p></li><li><p>Defense Sectors</p></li></ol><p>Each of these, my speculation is they will go significantly higher, particularly gold and silver. </p><p>Q: “So why aren’t you buying them yourself?!”</p><p>A: “Because I am more focused on a long term portfolio not as susceptible to headlines. Because I am busy in life right now and don’t have time for these trades. Because even though I think these assets will go parabolic, in the near term, it will not be a sustainable rise, and the reversal will be brutal (way worse than the -30% drop back on the 29th of January. It is just too many moving parts for me, personally, right now.”</p><p>I cover these simply because I know many of you are interested in my thoughts. </p><p>Most of my investments are built for the long haul in 2026…namely the finance sector that was derived from the <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/only-10-stocks-made-the-cut?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok ETF</a>. Kind of makes sense, as they are notorious for financing both sides of war. <strong>Do not get mad at me…my investments are no indication of who or what I support.</strong> Personal feelings go out the window when it comes to investing. </p><p>Even today, the ETF is pointing up slightly, while the S&amp;P 500 points down. This extreme resilience is a very promising sign to me for the months to come. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IxSL!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5ee47aba-e677-4e95-8ef7-c40e959d232a_1754x1780.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IxSL!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5ee47aba-e677-4e95-8ef7-c40e959d232a_1754x1780.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IxSL!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5ee47aba-e677-4e95-8ef7-c40e959d232a_1754x1780.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IxSL!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5ee47aba-e677-4e95-8ef7-c40e959d232a_1754x1780.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IxSL!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5ee47aba-e677-4e95-8ef7-c40e959d232a_1754x1780.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IxSL!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5ee47aba-e677-4e95-8ef7-c40e959d232a_1754x1780.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1478\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/5ee47aba-e677-4e95-8ef7-c40e959d232a_1754x1780.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1478,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:262305,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/189660316?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsub