.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">The StockTok ETF shows extreme resilience on macro market down days</figcaption></figure></div><p>As I continue to accumulate the long term portfolio, I will keep you updated. </p><h4>Do not forget to like ❤️ and re-stack to combat the AI slop here on substack! </h4><p>The <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary-fc6?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Screener</a> continues to find monster stocks. On February 17th I posted <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/leaders-forming-under-the-surface\">Leaders forming under the surface</a>, specifically naming FRO, RIG and VAL. Each of these stocks are up, with Frontline leading the pack, up over 17.4% in less than 2 weeks.  </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!s0Se!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb96e71af-0f3c-464f-9fe4-632ef8a67526_3138x2216.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!s0Se!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazon